msgctxt "56"
msgid "How to Play Count-Up:\\r\nIn this game, the numbers you hit are added to your score."
msgstr "Cómo jugar Count-up:\nEn este modo, los números que aciertes son añadidos a tu puntaje."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68"
msgid "When all rounds are concluded, the player with the higher score is declared the winner."
msgstr "Cuando terminen todas las rondas, el jugador con más puntaje gana."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "80"
msgid "In Count-Up, both the outer and inner bull are worth 50 points."
msgstr "En Count-up, tanto el bull exterior como el interior valen 50 puntos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "92"
msgid "Have fun and give it your all."
msgstr "Diviértete y da lo mejor de ti."

